  "description": "Yeong-sin, the third-generation heir of a large corporation, lived a life of luxury with endless wealth and women at his disposal. However, after being betrayed by a close associate, he ends up falling into the sea. Miraculously, he washes up on a remote island called \"Sodo,\" where he is saved by a mysterious and beautiful woman.\nWhat begins as a story of survival soon turns into something far more complicated as he encounters the women living on the island.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/intercourse)",
